## Advance, revisit, pause, and escalate

Advance this objective only after committed qualifying passes on both I1 and I2; do not imply durable retention until an eligible delayed check is recorded. If a required diagnostic is deficient, follow its named prerequisite explanation/support. End a session with the actual unfinished route when acquisition is unmet. If relevant notes/state change or the matched journal is incomplete, block this version pending plan reconciliation. A note error, source contradiction or absent provenance goes to ingest at the exact note/heading for checked repair. A missing lesson explanation or teaching bridge goes to plan as `plan_issue` under the self-contained lesson-content contract; plan may supply and verify that explanation without editing notes. Unsupported answer alternatives, ambiguous rubrics, missing prepared components or exhausted fresh I/D/C variants go to plan as `plan_issue`, with course ID, P002/V002/ingest 3, objective/criterion, item ID/version, exposed item IDs and the actual gap; do not invent or recycle a new assessment. Finite-bank exhaustion is a curriculum gap, not learner failure. No scheduler dates or learner status are written here.

